[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5400.07, "timestamp": "01:30:00", "text": "櫻花樹就離開，下一個人又會來欣賞我欣賞過的同一棵"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5401.561, "timestamp": "01:30:01", "author": "@Orange-Sleipnir", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_n5J-87avtPs7B_snpcnK5WQMhN-5kM_m8EJRYz2oJ72Wg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "I will smuggle the sakura tree"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5401.59, "timestamp": "01:30:01", "text": "櫻花樹。所以情況類似。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5414.229, "timestamp": "01:30:14", "text": "所以即使在現在，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5416.229, "timestamp": "01:30:16", "text": "我認為也有一些規則，有些規則是不能違反的，而且黑板上會寫著諸如“禁止插電”、“禁止等等等等”之類的東西，但通常他們不會寫出來，因為我的意思是，有些人認為這是常識，但我認為有些白人沒有這種常識。我想我也看過那個。  [音樂] 我忘了是誰了"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5425.256, "timestamp": "01:30:25", "author": "@saikatdey0909", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_mT2Up10wsYYwilcayEwYxOCwTgzDSnNztFejTB-x02nR8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "alright on my way to eat sakura tree"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5444.79, "timestamp": "01:30:44", "text": "。是的，那是 Twitch 主播 Misk 和一些人，他當時正在做健身之類的事情，例如從樹枝上舉重。  哦，我們可以吃櫻花樹。櫻花樹是可以吃的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5446.39, "timestamp": "01:30:46", "text": "。有很多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5447.83, "timestamp": "01:30:47", "text": "地方可以吃到櫻花樹。  好的。挺好的。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5449.448, "timestamp": "01:30:49", "author": "@Orange-Sleipnir", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_n5J-87avtPs7B_snpcnK5WQMhN-5kM_m8EJRYz2oJ72Wg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "go to mandarake as well"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5455.27, "timestamp": "01:30:55", "text": "你可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5458.07, "timestamp": "01:30:58", "text": "吃泡菜，櫻花樹，你可以吃我，櫻花我。你有很多東西。嗯"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5458.705, "timestamp": "01:30:58", "author": "@Orange-Sleipnir", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_n5J-87avtPs7B_snpcnK5WQMhN-5kM_m8EJRYz2oJ72Wg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "if you want collectibles"}]